1
00:00:00,829 --> 00:00:02,919
(Leonard:)Hey, Shelly.

2
00:00:03,081 --> 00:00:04,411
(Leonard:)What you doing?

3
00:00:04,583 --> 00:00:06,963
(Sheldon:)Size ratio was all wrong.
Couldn't visualize it.

4
00:00:07,127 --> 00:00:09,337
(Sheldon:)Needed bigger carbon atoms.

5
00:00:10,172 --> 00:00:12,132
(Leonard:)Sure, sure.

6
00:00:13,717 --> 00:00:15,677
(Leonard:)How did you get into this place?

7
00:00:15,844 --> 00:00:20,184
(Sheldon:)Back door has a five-pin tumbler system,
single circuit alarm. Child's play.

8
00:00:21,808 --> 00:00:24,518
(Sheldon:)You can start sorting
protons and neutrons...

9
00:00:24,686 --> 00:00:26,606
(Sheldon:)...while I build carbon atoms.

10
00:00:26,772 --> 00:00:29,562
(Leonard:)No, I don't think so.
We need to go home now.

11
00:00:30,484 --> 00:00:31,814
(Sheldon:)But I'm still working.

12
00:00:31,985 --> 00:00:35,445
(Leonard:)If you don't come out of there,
I'm gonna have to drag you out.

13
00:00:36,281 --> 00:00:37,661
(Sheldon:)You can try...

14
00:00:37,824 --> 00:00:39,244
(Sheldon:)...but you'll never catch me.

15
00:00:42,955 --> 00:00:45,455
For God sakes.

16
00:00:50,462 --> 00:00:52,132
(Leonard:)Sheldon, come here!

17
00:00:52,881 --> 00:00:54,461
Buzzinga.

18
00:00:56,635 --> 00:00:59,025
Buzzinga.

